      "html": "<article class=\"ds-pet-card\"><button class=\"ds-pet-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"示例学生 · 领养宠物\"><div class=\"ds-pet-image\"><span class=\"ds-pet-empty\"><span class=\"ds-pet-paw\"><svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"16\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v3.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-6.84 1.045Q6.52 17.48 4.455 15.84A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 6.5 9Z\"/></svg></span><span>选择一位成长伙伴</span></span><span class=\"ds-pet-level\">Lv.1</span></div><div class=\"ds-pet-info\"><div class=\"ds-pet-heading\"><strong>示例学生</strong><strong class=\"ds-pet-score\">0 <small>分</small></strong></div><p class=\"ds-pet-name\">等待领养 · 01</p><div class=\"ds-pet-growth-label\"><span>成长值</span><span>0 / 40</span></div><div class=\"ds-pet-track\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"宠物成长进度\" aria-valuenow=\"0\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"></div></div></button></article>",
      "css": ".ds-pet-card{width:210px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e9e6f1;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 12px -5px rgb(44 29 83 / .13);transition:box-shadow 180ms,border-color 180ms}.ds-pet-card:hover{border-color:#c9baff;box-shadow:0 8px 20px -10px rgb(67 41 122 / .2)}.ds-pet-action{display:block;width:100%;border:0;padding:0;background:transparent;text-align:left;color:#26233b;font-family:'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-pet-action:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#6d4aff);outline-offset:-3px}.ds-pet-image{position:relative;display:flex;aspect-ratio:1.12;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#fbfaff;padding:16px}.ds-pet-empty{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;color:#6e6a80;font-size:12px;line-height:16px}.ds-pet-paw{display:flex;width:64px;height:64px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:2px dashed #d0c4e7;border-radius:9999px;color:#9f8abb}.ds-pet-level{box-sizing:border-box;position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:12px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:28px;border:1px solid #e5ddf5;border-radius:9999px;background:#fff;padding:0 10px;color:#655183;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:1}.ds-pet-info{padding:16px}.ds-pet-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px}.ds-pet-score{color:#6d4aff;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}.ds-pet-score small{margin-left:4px;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;color:#6e6a80}.ds-pet-name{margin:0 0 16px;color:#6e6a80;font-size:12px;line-height:16px}.ds-pet-growth-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px;color:#6e6a80;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-pet-track{height:6px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:9999px;background:#ece7fa}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-pet-card{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
