      "refersTo": "select-trigger",
      "description": "展开样式静态预览；产品行为由 Radix Portal、键盘导航和选择实现，本预览不伪装交互。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-select-preview\"><button class=\"ds-select-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"班级选择样式预览\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14m0-14C9 4 4 4 2 4v15c4 0 7 0 10 2m0-14c3-3 8-3 10-3v15c-4 0-7 0-10 2\"/></svg><span>演示 · 三年级一班</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button><div class=\"ds-select-menu\"><div class=\"ds-select-option ds-select-selected\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14m0-14C9 4 4 4 2 4v15c4 0 7 0 10 2m0-14c3-3 8-3 10-3v15c-4 0-7 0-10 2\"/></svg><span>演示 · 三年级一班</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"ds-select-option\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14m0-14C9 4 4 4 2 4v15c4 0 7 0 10 2m0-14c3-3 8-3 10-3v15c-4 0-7 0-10 2\"/></svg><span>401</span></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-select-preview{max-width:280px;color:#26233b;font-family:'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px}.ds-select-trigger{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:40px;width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #6d4aff;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:#26233b;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-select-trigger span{flex:1;text-align:left}.ds-select-trigger:hover{border-color:#b8a6e3}.ds-select-trigger:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #dcd3fa;outline-offset:2px}.ds-select-menu{margin-top:6px;padding:6px;border:1px solid #e9e6f1;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / .1),0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / .1)}.ds-select-option{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:40px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px}.ds-select-option:hover,.ds-select-selected{background:#f0ebff;color:#6d4aff}.ds-select-selected{font-weight:600}.ds-select-option span{flex:1}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Celebration Continue Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "celebration-continue",
      "description": "全屏庆祝限定金色操作；完整结构与动效见 extensions.celebration/motion，不伪造宠物图片。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-celebration-continue\" type=\"button\">继续一起成长 <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-celebration-continue{display:inline-flex;min-height:46px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid #ffe097;border-radius:12px;background:#ffe3a0;color:#503715;padding:11px 24px;font-family:'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-celebration-continue:hover{background:#fff0c4;border-color:#fff0c4}.ds-celebration-continue:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffe097;outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-celebration-continue{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "班级宠物工作台",
    "overview": "明亮、温和而以操作为先。用户已经选择班级宠物工作台方向：学生与真实宠物图片是内容，紫色把评价、添加和选中状态连起来。白色表面置于浅紫灰底上，以细边框、柔和圆角和低阴影维持教室工作台的清晰度；不将本次界面改造成另一种视觉世界。\n\n中文与英文共用组件、布局和语义色。功能界面使用系统无衬线字体；登录插画区及全屏升级/毕业标题使用本地展示字体，让宠物的亲和力留在内容与入口，而不影响教师持续操作的可读性。此记录依据当前代码及提供的新旧截图增量更新，不是新一轮完成度审查。此前 ship 仅覆盖上一轮五项修复，不代表本轮新增需求已复审。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "浅紫灰画布、白色容器、紫色操作与成长反馈。",
      "紧凑的功能排版、细描边和柔和低阴影。",
      "真实 WebP 宠物素材、统一 Lucide 线性图标。",
      "中英文共用布局，手机保留两列学生卡片。",
      "Radix Select / Checkbox / Dialog 统一交互；金色全屏庆祝与局部飘分尊重 reduced-motion。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Accent Rule",
        "body": "紫色连接操作和成长；绿、红、琥珀保留成功、负向与徽章含义。局部加分用紫色飘分，全屏升级/毕业允许金色庆祝层；状态同时用文字、数值或图标表达。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Functional Voice Rule",
        "body": "展示字体只服务登录插画大标题与全屏升级/毕业标题；常规工作台、表单、导航、数值与普通弹窗继续使用功能字体。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Soft Layer Rule",
        "body": "表面用细线和柔影分层；悬停不位移内容，弹窗依靠遮罩与高影明确前后关系。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 复用紫色操作、白色表面与语义状态色，按 Semantic Accent Rule 保留含义。",
      "**Do** 为中英文共用可换行布局、关联字段标签、键盘焦点与可访问名称。",
      "**Do** 使用 Lucide SVG、完整展示宠物图片，并保留第三方素材来源与授权提示。",
      "**Do** 复用 Radix Select / Checkbox / Dialog、Lucide 与功能字体，保留静态可读的 reduced-motion 反馈。",
      "**Do** 区分批量同时飘分与升级逐位庆祝，保留继续、Esc 和关闭全部操作。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 将登录/庆祝展示字体和插画构图推广到工作台表单或导航。",
      "**Don't** 将绿、红或徽章琥珀替换为无语义的装饰性操作主色。",
      "**Don't** 把截图中的六列、局部 11px 标签或局部圆角提升为所有页面的通用规则。",
      "**Don't** 用字符图标、裁切宠物或移除焦点轮廓来替换现有组件。",
      "**Don't** 将缺少八张独立阶段图的宠物以单图或异风格占位开放领养，也不要把缺少的 24 张记为完成。"
    ]
  }
}
